[TITLE]
API-03: pipe P2 is set by a simple control and a rule; the test gives it a check valve

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     100
 J2   0     100

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000    12    100    0      Open

[CONTROLS]
 LINK P2 CLOSED AT TIME 2     ; sets P2

[RULES]
RULE 1
IF JUNCTION J1 PRESSURE > 1000
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE 2
IF PIPE P2 FLOW > 1000
THEN PIPE P1 STATUS IS CLOSED

[TIMES]
 Duration   4:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units      GPM
 Headloss   H-W

[END]
